  "content_text": "For \"no need\" in that sentence, I keep defaulting to \"don't need to\" — but the correct reading was \"don't design around BearEcho's format\".\n[这句话里的「不需要」我老是习惯用中文思维往 don't need to 上靠，但其实正确读法是 don't design around BearEcho's format]\nThat line nails the current state of AI agents.\n[这句话很精辟地描述了现在 AI agent 的现状]\nDo we already have a cron for pruning slop? Isn't that overlapping with the notes loop?\n[我们是不是有重构删除 slop 的 cron，与笔记 loop 是不是重合了]\nAs you know, my phone is a Xiaomi 14 Ultra.\n[如你所知，我的手机是小米 14 Ultra]\nI'm wondering what else this phone can do for fun.\n[我想知道，手机还有什么好玩的地方]\nI don't play mobile games anymore, and I've uninstalled all the short-video apps — even Bilibili.\n[我现在不玩手机游戏了，短视频 app 也都尽量卸载了，连 B 站都卸了]\nAt this point, what I actually use is WeChat and X — the rest I barely touch.\n[到了这个地步，我真正常用的就是微信和 X，其他的基本不碰]\nBeyond that, what else do you think a phone is good for?\n[除此之外，你觉得手机还有什么有趣的地方]",
